{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B435eA21ured1whKuKtq4g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.545544+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B435eA21ured1whKuKtq4g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>药学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名现已正式开启，欢迎校内外广大优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式攻读我院2026年博士生、硕士生！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、学校及学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>华东师范大学</span></strong></span><span>是教育部直属重点大学、国家</span><strong><span>“双一流”、“211工程”和“985工程”</span></strong><span>重点建设高校。2017年，学校进入</span><strong><span>世界一流大学A类建设高校</span></strong><span>行列；2022年，入选第二轮国家“双一流”建设名单。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gickx5XbWKFm5zmIY7lqcjmUEVSEvNf7Cdr7a4PmUf2lic6gUibcibS1yPdn8Jz2F8BbApP8lzvibwa38icydtdRPH8A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>药学院</span></strong></span><span>下设药物科学系和药物工程系，现已拥有</span><strong><span>药学一级学科博士点</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>生物与医药工程博士点</span></strong><span>。学院依托华东师范大学在药学、计算机科学、化学、生物学、软件工程、统计学、心理学等强势学科优势，</span><strong><span><span>围绕</span>化学、基因、细胞、数字四类药物</span></strong><span>，重点发展</span><strong><span>人工智能药学 、药物智造、数字药物、生物药物与递送系统</span></strong><span>等前沿技术和方向，通过多学科的交叉融合，培养“全面而自由”的面向国际前沿和国家战略需求的高精尖缺“药学英才”。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gickx5XbWKFm5zmIY7lqcjmUEVSEvNf7Cic7Ry3j87NibVvJiaDxT0m8qP6icdqYhNlIp5W0ibAgvmXMQK2gaSVIQV5A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>在人才培养方面，自2023年5月开始，</span><strong><span>至今已有超150名在读研究生和博士生</span></strong><span>。在合作交流方面，</span><strong><span>现已与十余家生物医药事业单位或企业签订了合作协议</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gickx5XbWKFm5zmIY7lqcjmUEVSEvNf7CyZUfuKYibaFjsMicVibEE1RskeXLcwJo3SlXESzfLwV0D78pao2RtYyvQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gickx5XbWKFm5zmIY7lqcjmUEVSEvNf7CNUzQOJUsR3DcTiaMEWIuckOPgHHtA2oicsM1auuB5L28ZOhz0Va8vb8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>并与</span><strong><span>多家上市药企签约合作共建药学联合实验室</span></strong><span>。<span>多家</span></span><strong><span>合作企业专门设置了奖学金</span></strong><span>，定向支持药学院的人才培养工作。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、报名条件及要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好</span></p><p><span>2. <span>药学、化学、生命科学、计算机、软件、数学、物理、机械等相关专业</span>，学习成绩优异的优秀应届本科毕业生，并已获得或预计能够获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3. 具有一定学科背景，并具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质、专业基础等。身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gickx5XbWKFm5zmIY7lqcjmUEVSEvNf7CPlMibd1OTicCu9RfXwGqgibnH9lFgWX4JhvI9VshtNx9fQ1JpxOOJ6ltQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>直博生报考相关说明：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>直博生入学后适用博士研究生的管理规章制度，享受博士研究生的同等待遇，履行博士研究生的相关义务。本方案未尽事宜请遵照当年度博士招生章程执行。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>四、报名方式与要求</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 考生需通过我校研究生报考服务系统（网址：https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5）报名。</span></p><p><span>2. 系统开放时间：</span><strong><span><span>2025年9月1日9:00--9月14日17:00</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. 请考生按照系统要求提交材料，同时须保证提交材料真实、准确，无弄虚作假、学术不端。</span><strong><span>如发现申请材料有虚假成分，立即取消申请人一切资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名后，</span><strong><span><span>请务必密切关注邮箱，我院复试通知将以邮件的形式通知。</span></span></strong><span><strong><span>未接到复试通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></strong></span><span>（学校推免招生工作办法及我院实施细则预计9月中旬发布）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.最终信息以中国研究生招生信息网（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn）、学校研招网另行公布为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读学校2026年博士、硕士研究生者均须在正式取得推免生资格，且在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp）开通后，另履行正式的填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等程序。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>如错过预报名，可待上述教育部系统开通后直接报名；学院将结合实际确定是否再次组织推免招生复试考核与录取。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>咨询联系方式：何老师邮箱：jiaoxue@pharm.ecnu.edu.cn，电话13371859379</span></p><p><span>咨询时间：周一至周五，9:00-11:30,13:00-17:00</span></p><p><span>监督申诉渠道：陈老师邮箱：cchen@sfs.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>请密切关注学校研招网及学院官方通知、资讯。我院近期还将于2025年9月6日（周六）下午3:30-4:30组织在线直播宣讲，欢迎关注。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>华东师范大学药学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年9月1日</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6e43a193f630a381d665e264ada1b8e7d04dc9d7f6ca4b009ff2c448fb64d4ff","textLength":1501,"sourceSha256":"4c7549346261038b1a04788494a9cdb32c554a70c6f2a3e0401c557e7a664467","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2122c4afa445d857f9f5","title":"2025年华东师范大学药学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生 推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.545544+00:00"}
